OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome early
OL,6,Fevening brightness possible, but also
OL,7,Fisolated outbreaks of light rain. Then
OL,8,Fdry with clear spells overnight, this
OL,9,Fallowing for areas of fog to form,
OL,10,Fmainly in rural parts. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FEarly mist and fog patches
OL,13,Fwill slowly clear to leave another
OL,14,Ffine day, with bright or sunny spells.
OL,15,FPerhaps some thicker cloud in the
OL,16,Fnorth. Feeling warm. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
